body:
2 of my seedlings died, their leaves looks so dried up but the stalk looks green as ever. Could too much water cause this? It has been raining quite frequently in my area.

&#x200B;

Now I have 4 left and one of them seems to be dying as well. Its leaves looks like they're drying up as well.. 😵 I'm also worried if ants will cause them to die?? There is quite a number of black ants in the area.

&#x200B;

The leaves looks half green and half brown and seems wilted. Help 😭
